            <sparkle:version>9</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.5.0</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>13.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description><![CDATA[<h3>BarDeck 1.5.0</h3>
<p><strong>New</strong></p>
<ul>
  <li><strong>Menu bar mode.</strong> Right-click and choose <em>Show BarDeck in</em> to use the floating bar, the menu bar, or both. In the menu bar your buttons appear as a menu in the same colours, with stacks and folders as submenus, volume and brightness sliders, live values and the current app&#8217;s buttons.</li>
  <li><strong>Pin to menu bar.</strong> Give any button its own menu bar item, showing its live value, share price or current track. Up to five.</li>
  <li>Live data buttons show when they last updated (hover over the button), say &#8220;stale&#8221; when a refresh has failed, and scripts can report their own errors.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
