            <description><![CDATA[<h3>BarDeck 1.4.1</h3>
<p><strong>Fixed</strong></p>
<ul>
  <li>The edit window for Live data buttons no longer cuts off its labels and hint text.</li>
  <li>A Live data button now always shows its title and value in full. When space is short, the small detail line is shortened first.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
